    "speaker": "Rahul Bharti",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "Coming to products, demonstrating its commitment to customer safety, the company is now offering 6 airbags as standard in almost all of its passenger vehicle product lineup- volumes going beyond 99% and advanced safety features like Electronic Stability Control, Anti-lock Braking System with Electronic Brakeforce Distribution as a standard across the entire product lineup.",
